# Nougat MMD — STUB

This file is intentionally a stub.

The source PDF (Park et al. 2022, Scientific Reports 12:11345,
doi:10.1038/s41598-022-15521-y) is born-digital with clean embedded
text and equations. It was extracted using `pdftotext -layout` into
`../ocr/raw_layout.txt`, which was sufficient for the analytical
reproduction (all Table 1, Table 2, Table 3, Eq. 2, Eq. 3, Eq. 5-8
values were recovered accurately from that extraction).

Nougat OCR was not run in this session:
- No layout-recovery gain over pdftotext for this born-digital PDF.
- No math-mode-recovery need: equations came through the text layer.
- Session had no Nougat GPU allocation (would need uicgpu queue).

Follow-up (if desired): re-run under
`nougat --model 0.1.0-base --recompute`
against the source PDF on any free GPU endpoint; expected output would
be the article body in MathPix Markdown format. Estimated wall-clock
~5-10 minutes on a single A100.

Source PDF: not embedded in this repo (copyright); available at the
DOI above.
